#### flushed_lsn advances after flush_wal

- Verify: flushed_lsn advances after flush_wal
   - Expected: w.flushed_lsn() equals `lsn.value`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 8 lines folded for reproduction.
